Package: bboxai-desktop
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Zainal Abidin <zainalabidin@unimap.edu.my>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, curl, openssl, postgresql, nginx, libgl1, libglib2.0-0
Description: bboxAI desktop — local image/video annotation + YOLOv8 training
 Installs bbox-api (FastAPI backend), bbox-agent, and a pre-built bbox-web
 UI as systemd-managed services on this machine, fronted by nginx. Local UI
 at http://bboxai:8321 once installed. Away-from-home access via
 bboxai-remote.unitani.com activates automatically the first time you
 register an account through the UI. Use bboxai-enable-remote only to
 switch which local account is the remote-enabled one.
